{
  "$comment": "Additive capabilities. Every key a feature introduces is listed under it, so an older kit answers skip, never fail. request_fields name `<schema>.<property>` or `<METHOD route>?<param>`; reply_fields `<schema>.<property>`. Each is marked x-feature in the schema or OpenAPI. Nothing is deprecated in major 2. `subjects.paged` is deferred (decision 27) and not listed.",
  "features": {
    "operations": {
      "meaning": "One-shot operations.",
      "routes": [
        "POST /operations/{name}"
      ],
      "request_fields": [],
